  "summary": "<p>Ford Motor Company announced it will reshore production of its Lincoln models to the United States — phasing out imports from China and creating thousands of new American jobs. This is the latest proof that President Donald J. Trump’s America First trade agenda is delivering exactly as designed: rewarding domestic manufacturing, protecting American workers, and [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/08/president-trumps-trade-agenda-is-rebuilding-the-american-auto-industry/\">President Trump’s Trade Agenda Is Rebuilding the American Auto Industry</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
